# U44: the character list's failure paths and the league dropdown. Account names whose recorded
# get-characters response is a 404 ("Account name is incorrect."), a 403 ("Account profile is
# private or does not exist."), an empty list ("The account has no characters to import.") and
# an HTML page (ProcessSiteJSON fails: "Error processing character list, try again later"); then
# a good account and "All" in the league dropdown (BuildCharacterList with no league: the detail
# names each character's league).
